{"unit_id":"Stijnus__dsh-move-to-workspace#feature-1","repo":"Stijnus/dsh-move-to-workspace","commit":"21a3fbda64f9bf17848bb1ac48caf7dbf2b33b83","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-move-to-workspace 的功能「移动会话」：从会话菜单选择目标工作区后，Host 将完整会话日志复制到新会话并附加到目标工作区，随后归档原会话；若会话目录已是目标目录，则直接附加现有会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:147","index.js:201"]}
